    {
      "id": "whats-next-instructions",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "How to read this plan",
      "position": {
        "x": 2080,
        "y": -760
      },
      "width": 520,
      "height": 260,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "whats-next-declaration"
        },
        "markdown": "# How to read this plan\n\n- The six numbered **phases** run left to right and are done in that order. Each holds the **actions** beneath it.\n- **Carried, not scheduled** is the seventh column: known work that blocks nothing.\n- The **decisions** along the top are made. The five in the right-hand column are the open questions navigation has to answer.\n- **Michael looks at the demos** is the gate on phase 1.\n- **Constraints** are how the work is done. **Risks** each have a **contingency** beside them.\n\nStatus is kept in `plans/whats-next/build.cjs`, in the `statuses` list. Change it there and run `node plans/whats-next/build.cjs`.\n\nTwo Portals stand beside the navigation questions: **The navigation scheme**, the agreed document in canon, and **Navigation today**, what the app does now and the order to build the difference in.\n\nThe demos are at `graphs/commons-demo`, `graphs/boulevard-demo` and `graphs/twilite-demo`. The designs are on the canvas, in the row headed “The rooms behind the root”."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "whats-next-the-plan",
      "type": "plan",
      "label": "Make the Twilite Zone walkable",
      "position": {
        "x": -800,
        "y": -760
      },
      "width": 360,
      "height": 220,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "goal",
          "key": "goal",
          "label": "goal",
          "direction": "output",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 0,
          "allowedEdgeTypes": [
            "plan.achieves"
          ],
          "metadata": {
            "semantic": true,
            "roles": [
              "plan.achieves"
            ],
            "repeatable": false
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "phases",
          "key": "phases",
          "label": "phases",
          "direction": "output",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 65,
          "allowedEdgeTypes": [
            "plan.contains"
          ],
          "metadata": {
            "semantic": true,
            "roles": [
              "plan.contains"
            ],
            "repeatable": true
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "constraints",
          "key": "constraints",
          "label": "constraints",
          "direction": "output",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 115,
          "allowedEdgeTypes": [
            "plan.constrained-by"
